        "quote_count": 11,
        "reply_count": 51,
        "retweet_count": 87
      },
      "text": "Peter Thiel’s criticism was famously “we asked for flying cars and got 140 characters”\n\nWell now, we have an on-demand artist, on-demand expert chatbot, on-demand copywriter, on-demand pair programmer…\n\nWe’re entering the sci-fi age with AI. Buckle up!",
