        "quote_count": 11,
        "reply_count": 34,
        "retweet_count": 45
      },
      "text": "Silicon Valley is full of tourists. It’s absolutely toxic\n\nThe promiscuity of tech is blasphemy to any wise business leader of the previous generation\n\nHuman history is written by people who go all-in. Take your commitments seriously; give it your all.\n\nFickleness results in ruin",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1602083905565495297"
