        "like_count": 689,
        "quote_count": 46,
        "reply_count": 105,
        "retweet_count": 24
      },
      "text": "Something I wish existed:\n\nImmediately in a conversation with someone, I could know the set of topics that we’re both deeply curious and/or knowledge about.\n\nConferences are the weakest form of this—ostensibly everyone is interested in the conf topic.\n\nNeed the generic solution!",
