        "quote_count": 4,
        "reply_count": 23,
        "retweet_count": 57
      },
      "text": "a guide to a fulfilling life:\n\nthe hard shit is the shit worth doing.\n\ndo you want to be the guy who only does easy shit? only swimming downstream? who would say yes to that?\n\ndon’t waste time on the meaningless hard shit\n\n…but fight valiantly for the hard shit that matters.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1601074113346686976"
