        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 11,
        "retweet_count": 50
      },
      "text": "It’s always obvious whether or not people truly care about their work based on the output.\n\nThis is true for buildings, software, writing, cuisine—everything.\n\nIt’s as if the maker whispers into your ear—“I tried to make something worthwhile”\n\nAlways give a shit. Don’t half ass.",
