      "text": "My biggest mistakes in life (so far):\n\n1—Forgetting who is truly there for me (the Real ones)\n2—Not telling them I appreciate &amp; love them\n3—Getting off the learning treadmill at times. NEVER stop voraciously learning\n4—Not asking for help when I’ve needed it\n5—Not writing enough",
