      "text": "@paulg That’s true from a core technology perspective. But the majority of the “tech” industry is actually about the application of existing innovation, and we should be far more directed.\n\nThere was no way for a hedge fund trader to stave off the Ukraine war",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1599122352952217600"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
