        "text": "We’re excited to unlock unlimited creativity for brands, marketplaces, startups, and independent retailers to have their products shine for the holidays.\n\nForge is now available for Early Access with a broader release in January. Join the waitlist at\n\nhttps://t.co/mMJkE4XmKi"
